<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-UNIBANKA EDGES HIGHER, JEKABPILS DOWN.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-UNIBANKA EDGES HIGHER, JEKABPILS DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanka made up some more ground</p>
<p>on the bourse on Monday while Jekabpils Sugar slipped after</p>
<p>gains last week on the back of well-received first half results.</p>
